      "content": "thanks, i'll check those. i'm pretty sure i have the bucket policy right, but it's feeling like someone is actively blocking me for no reason lol. \n\nactually, can u check if there's any weird way a service control policy (SCP) or something could be overriding my iam role? i'm in an org and sometimes it feels like permissions just vanish into thin air.",
